{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0152cE7skR3vHmpd58bsKnWd","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Implementation Plan\n     2→Generated: 2026-03-19T00:00:00Z\n     3→Total_Items: 19\n     4→Completed: 1\n     5→Test_Items: 9 (target: ≥70% of implementation items → 9/11 = 82%)\n     6→\n     7→## Dependency Graph\n     8→```\n     9→Independent_Groups:\n    10→  - group_1: [Item 1, Item 2, Item 3]                         # models, DTOs, schema — no dependencies\n    11→  - group_2: [Item 4, Item 5, Item 6, Item 7, Item 8]         # config, mapper, validator, test infra — depends on group_1\n    12→  - group_3: [Item 9, Item 10, Item 11, Item 12, Item 13, Item 14]  # service, exception handler, early tests — depends on group_2\n    13→  - group_4: [Item 15, Item 16]                                # service tests, controller — depends on group_3\n    14→  - group_5: [Item 17, Item 18, Item 19]                       # controller integration tests — depends on group_4\n    15→Build_Order: group_1 → group_2 → group_3 → group_4 → group_5\n    16→```\n    17→\n    18→---\n    19→\n    20→## Item 1: Employee model class\n    21→- status: DONE\n    22→- priority: P0\n    23→- complexity: S\n    24→- depends_on: []\n    25→- spec: specs/employee-crud-api.md\n    26→- clarity_ref: CLARITY_LOG.md#Round-1 (R1.9 date format, R1.20 timestamp format)\n    27→- description: Create the Employee entity in `com.example.legacy.model` with fields: id (Long), name (String), email (String), department (String), salary (BigDecimal), hireDate (Date), createdAt (Timestamp), updatedAt (Timestamp). Add Jackson annotations for date serialization — hireDate as \"yyyy-MM-dd\", timestamps as \"yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss\". Standard getters/setters, Java 1.8 style.\n    28→- acceptance: Class compiles. Fields match spec types. Jackson annotations produce correct date formats when serialized.\n    29→- tests: Covered by Item 11 (Model & DTO unit tests)\n    30→\n  